Negative line number.
Negative: exit 2, invalid position. "-" is the range separator, so ":-5:6" has an empty start and the message is "missing start position" rather than one about a negative line; it must not resolve to 5:6.
-- args --
internal/platform/platform.go:-5:6
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
errtrace: invalid position "internal/platform/platform.go:-5:6": missing start position
-- exit --
2
